#. module: sale_payment_options
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_payment_options
msgid ""
".. |company| replace:: ADHOC SA\n"
"\n"
".. |company_logo| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ingadhoc/maintainer-tools/master/resources/adhoc-logo.png\n"
"   :alt: ADHOC SA\n"
"   :target: https://www.adhoc.com.ar\n"
"\n"
".. |icon| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ingadhoc/maintainer-tools/master/resources/adhoc-icon.png\n"
"\n"
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"   :target: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"=====================\n"
"Sale Payment Options\n"
"=====================\n"
"\n"
"Allows defining and displaying multiple payment options on quotations and sales orders.\n"
"\n"
"- Configure several payment options per sales order.\n"
"- Edit payment options only through a wizard.\n"
"- Reusable payment option templates.\n"
"- Visual display of payment options in the order.\n"
"- Automatic recalculation if the order total changes.\n"
"- Each payment option can have multiple installment plans.\n"
"- Payment options are printed from their own report action, with tables, subtotals, and totals.\n"
"- Handles missing or malformed data gracefully in reports.\n"
"- Optionally, print the installment amounts per sale order line instead of the order-wide table.\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"To install this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Just install.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To print the installment amounts discriminated by line, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Go to *Sales > Configuration > Settings > Quotations & Orders*.\n"
"#. Enable *Payment Options Display: Discriminate by sale order line*.\n"
"\n"
"With that option enabled the printed quotation shows, under each line, the amount per\n"
"installment of every payment option, prefixed with the name of its installment plan (e.g.\n"
"*Cash discount (CASH): 1 installments of $ 41,600.00 | Plan 6 (CARD): 6 installments of\n"
"$ 24,000.00*), and the order-wide payment options table is not printed. The setting is per\n"
"company.\n"
"\n"
"The installment amounts are always computed on the line amount with taxes included, no\n"
"matter whether the report prints the line amounts with or without taxes: they are what\n"
"the customer is going to pay.\n"
"\n"
"Printing\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"The module adds a second print action, *Quotation / Order (Payment Options)*, next to the\n"
"standard one. The standard action prints the quotation as always, without any payment\n"
"option; this one prints it with them.\n"
"\n"
"Both print the same document: the report action only calls the standard wrapper with a flag\n"
"in the context, instead of rendering the quotation document itself. That is what keeps the\n"
"localizations working, because they register their own version of the document on that\n"
"wrapper (in Argentina, the header, the identification block and the *Discriminate Taxes*\n"
"setting of the sale order type).\n"
"\n"
"The totals summary of the order is always printed, with the payment options below it.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"#. Open a sales order and go to the \"Payment Options\" tab.\n"
"#. Click \"Edit Payment Options\" to use the wizard.\n"
"#. Select a template or add payment lines manually.\n"
"#. Save to apply the payment options to the order.\n"
"#. The summary appears in the order (read-only).\n"
"#. Print with *Quotation / Order (Payment Options)* to get them on the PDF, as a table\n"
"   with installment details and totals, or discriminated by line if the setting above is\n"
"   enabled.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues\n"
"<https://github.com/ingadhoc/sale/issues>`_. In case of trouble, please\n"
"check there if your issue has already been reported. If you spotted it first,\n"
"help us smashing it by providing a detailed and welcomed feedback.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Images\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* |company| |icon|\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* ADHOC SA <https://www.adhoc.com.ar>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
"|company_logo|\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by the |company|.\n"
"\n"
"To contribute to this module, please visit https://www.adhoc.com.ar.\n"
msgstr ""
".. |company| replace:: ADHOC SA\n"
"\n"
".. |company_logo| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ingadhoc/maintainer-tools/master/resources/adhoc-logo.png\n"
"   :alt: ADHOC SA\n"
"   :target: https://www.adhoc.com.ar\n"
"\n"
".. |icon| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ingadhoc/maintainer-tools/master/resources/adhoc-icon.png\n"
"\n"
".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"   :target: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"=====================\n"
"Sale Payment Options\n"
"=====================\n"
"\n"
"Permite definir y mostrar varias opciones de pago en presupuestos y pedidos de venta.\n"
"\n"
"- Configure varias opciones de pago por pedido de venta.\n"
"- Edite las opciones de pago solo a través de un asistente.\n"
"- Plantillas de opciones de pago reutilizables.\n"
"- Visualización de las opciones de pago en el pedido.\n"
"- Recálculo automático si cambia el total del pedido.\n"
"- Cada opción de pago puede tener varios planes de cuotas.\n"
"- Las opciones de pago se imprimen desde su propia acción de reporte, con tablas, subtotales y totales.\n"
"- Maneja sin errores los datos faltantes o mal formados en los reportes.\n"
"- Opcionalmente, imprima los importes de las cuotas por línea del pedido de venta en lugar de la tabla del pedido completo.\n"
"\n"
"Instalación\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Para instalar este módulo, es necesario:\n"
"\n"
"#. Solo instalarlo.\n"
"\n"
"Configuración\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Para imprimir los importes de las cuotas discriminados por línea, es necesario:\n"
"\n"
"#. Ir a *Ventas > Configuración > Ajustes > Presupuestos y pedidos*.\n"
"#. Activar *Visualización de opciones de pago: discriminar por línea del pedido de venta*.\n"
"\n"
"Con esa opción activada, el presupuesto impreso muestra, debajo de cada línea, el importe\n"
"por cuota de cada opción de pago, precedido por el nombre de su plan de cuotas (por ejemplo,\n"
"*Descuento contado (CASH): 1 installments of $ 41,600.00 | Plan 6 (CARD): 6 installments of\n"
"$ 24,000.00*), y no se imprime la tabla de opciones de pago del pedido completo. El ajuste\n"
"es por compañía.\n"
"\n"
"Los importes de las cuotas siempre se calculan sobre el importe de la línea con impuestos\n"
"incluidos, sin importar si el reporte imprime los importes de la línea con o sin impuestos:\n"
"son lo que va a pagar el cliente.\n"
"\n"
"Impresión\n"
"=========\n"
"\n"
"El módulo agrega una segunda acción de impresión, *Quotation / Order (Payment Options)*, al\n"
"lado de la estándar. La acción estándar imprime el presupuesto como siempre, sin ninguna\n"
"opción de pago; esta lo imprime con ellas.\n"
"\n"
"Las dos imprimen el mismo documento: la acción de reporte solo llama al contenedor estándar\n"
"con una marca en el contexto, en vez de renderizar el documento del presupuesto. Eso es lo\n"
"que mantiene funcionando a las localizaciones, porque registran su propia versión del\n"
"documento sobre ese contenedor (en Argentina, el encabezado, el bloque de identificación y\n"
"el ajuste *Discriminar impuestos* del tipo de pedido de venta).\n"
"\n"
"El resumen de totales del pedido siempre se imprime, con las opciones de pago debajo.\n"
"\n"
"Uso\n"
"===\n"
"\n"
"#. Abra un pedido de venta y vaya a la pestaña \"Payment Options\".\n"
"#. Haga clic en \"Edit Payment Options\" para usar el asistente.\n"
"#. Elija una plantilla o agregue líneas de pago a mano.\n"
"#. Guarde para aplicar las opciones de pago al pedido.\n"
"#. El resumen aparece en el pedido (solo lectura).\n"
"#. Imprima con *Quotation / Order (Payment Options)* para obtenerlas en el PDF, como una\n"
"   tabla con el detalle de las cuotas y los totales, o discriminadas por línea si el ajuste\n"
"   de arriba está activado.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Los errores se registran en `GitHub Issues\n"
"<https://github.com/ingadhoc/sale/issues>`_. Ante cualquier problema, revise\n"
"ahí si ya fue reportado. Si lo encontró primero, ayúdenos a resolverlo\n"
"aportando un informe detallado.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Images\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* |company| |icon|\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* ADHOC SA <https://www.adhoc.com.ar>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainer\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
"|company_logo|\n"
"\n"
"Este módulo es mantenido por |company|.\n"
"\n"
"Para contribuir a este módulo, visite https://www.adhoc.com.ar."

